            "review_title": "Review at Jejuga - Korean BBQ",
            "review_text": "LookingForAnOdyssey\nTokyo, Japan79 contributions\n0\nGreat Korean BBQ\nDec 2023 • Family\nYum Korean BBQ. The service was generally good and the food quality was also good. Would recommend to those looking for a change on their trip to Vietnam!\n\nThe staff seemed to have a good level of English, which we appreciated, and one of the male team members (sadly didn't get his name) was a great cook.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 28, 2023",
