            "review_title": "Review at Jejuga - Korean BBQ",
            "review_text": "tieu112\nNha Trang, Vietnam104 contributions\n0\nGood, high quality beef and pork BBQ\nNov 2019 • Couples\nWe are local residents and love Korean BBQ. We been looking for a new Korean BBQ since our other favorite restaurant has declined in quality.\n\nThis restaurant is at the southern end of the main beach strip. Very clean and decorative restaurant. However, no space to park motorbike. Suggest walking or taking taxi.\n\nWe ordered the beef sirloin and pork belly. The beef had good marbling and tasted great. The same with pork belly, tasty. We also ordered Kim chi soup and that had a very good spicy broth. All the small side dishes were also very tasty and good quality. The vegetables were fresh and green. They serve the traditional Korean black rice, delicious and very healthy.\n\nBeef sirloin and pork belly, kim chi soup and 2 bottles of Chamisul soju totaled 1.2 million VND, just about 55 USD. We left full sns very happy. We will be back because we found our new favorite Korean BBQ.\nRead more\nWritten November 26, 2019",
